Subject: [PATCH] Updates from GitHub

About once a day, and from the menu (Check for updates), the app looks
for a newer SeerrMobile release. On Android it downloads the APK and
opens Android's installer; the APK is deleted once the new version
starts. On an iPhone the new version opens in AltStore or SideStore,
or the release page.
